9
01:09:45,000 --> 01:09:51,000
Toby Jay Wadenah, played by Benicio del Toro.

10
01:17:30,000 --> 01:17:36,000
The Pledge is a 2001 American neo-noir psychological mystery thriller drama film directed by Sean Penn and starring Jack Nicholson alongside an ensemble supporting cast of
Patricia Clarkson, Aaron Eckhart, Helen Mirren, Robin Wright Penn, Vanessa Redgrave, Sam Shepard, Mickey Rourke, Tom Noonan, Lois Smith and Benicio del Toro.

11
01:25:15,000 --> 01:25:21,000
It competed at the 2001 Cannes Film Festival.

12
01:33:00,000 --> 01:33:06,000
The Pledge is based on Friedrich Dürrenmatt's 1958 novella
The Pledge: Requiem for the Detective Novel.

13
01:40:45,000 --> 01:40:51,000
Dürrenmatt wrote the novella to refine the theme he originally developed in the screenplay for
the 1958 German-language film It Happened in Broad Daylight with Heinz Rühmann.

14
01:48:30,000 --> 01:48:36,000
The film explores themes of promise, murder, drawing, porcupine, pledge.

15
01:56:15,000 --> 01:56:21,000
The tone is intense and emotional and mind_bending.
